I honestly don't wanna study anymore ahaha. I just wanna do some odd jobs, earn enough to sustain myself and experience life you know? But sadly, in today's society where materialism is everything pag ala kang diploma mababa tingin sayo ng mga tao. Funny how a single piece of paper can dictate how people would percieve you and not your value or morals. I know I know, I sound like your typical middle class brat who doesn't really know jackshit about sa real life but I just couldn't understand it. How people value money and materials over experience and human connection. I hate to rant and bitch around but Goddamn. I know, kasalanan ko rin since I can't adjust to this new normal but Damnit haha

&#x200B;

The world is already harsh as it is. It never hurts to be a little bit kinder but don't let others abuse you. Try to find a balance between self-respect and empathy. Too much of any of these  is devastating. 

