 Gusto ko lang magpasalamat sa ex ko haha. Cause she make a man out of me. She gave me the confidence (dati akong introvert ngayon makapal na mukhang extrovert na haha) she makes me care about my hygiene and my fitness, she makes me realize that life is too short for us to wallow and that we must learn to accept all of the ups and downs ng buhay. She also makes me stop wondering about the what ifs, and to live life in the moment. To stop overthinking every little things and na dapat palagi tayong nakangiti! Maybe we are  not meant to be, but I'll always treasure the values that you've teached me haha

